       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 5,000 mg three times daily is 15 g/day, almost four times the usual adult maximum of 4 g/day. At that dose, even with normal liver function, there is a serious risk of hepatotoxicity. A single 5,000 mg dose is also well above the typical 1,000 mg maximum per dose.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n\n- **500 mg** PO three times daily (1.5 g/day)\n- **650 mg** PO three times daily (1.95 g/day)\n- **1,000 mg** PO three times daily (3 g/day), a common regimen for a 70 kg adult with normal liver function\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 5,000 mg TID, please confirm that explicitly and give me the clinical rationale for the order note. I'd still advise checking with pharmacy first."
